{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/davinci_seven/status/2089196207138550270","id":"2089196207138550270","text":"开源了公众号排版skill，一键复制粘贴，欢迎⭐ \nhttps://github.com/davinci-seven/wechat-article-pipeline https://x.com/i/article/2089193819954696192","raw_text":{"text":"开源了公众号排版skill，一键复制粘贴，欢迎⭐ \nhttps://t.co/P5c5kalXE3 https://t.co/7OiEZaDvyR","display_text_range":[0,73],"facets":[{"type":"url","indices":[26,49],"original":"https://t.co/P5c5kalXE3","replacement":"https://github.com/davinci-seven/wechat-article-pipeline","display":"github.com/davinci-seven/…"},{"type":"url","indices":[50,73],"original":"https://t.co/7OiEZaDvyR","replacement":"https://x.com/i/article/2089193819954696192","display":"x.com/i/article/2089…"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"davinci_seven","url":"https://x.com/davinci_seven","id":"1516975944484990977","followers":22252,"following":1291,"likes":42285,"media_count":3689,"name":"达芬七Seven","description":"加拿大🇨🇦10年｜Stanley-Team成员｜专业卡台→海外支付/AI订阅/广告投流 |  AI工具、本地模型｜Learn in Public","raw_description":{"text":"加拿大🇨🇦10年｜Stanley-Team成员｜专业卡台→海外支付/AI订阅/广告投流 |  AI工具、本地模型｜Learn in Public","facets":[]},"location":"支付👉","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1516975944484990977/1771266928","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2074924490245410816/Hz-xUG1f_200x200.jpg","joined":"Thu Apr 21 03:04:01 +0000 2022","protected":false,"website":{"url":"https://vcardvirtual.cc/login?invite_code=qfMgYK","display_url":"vcardvirtual.cc/login?invite_c…"},"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"avatar_color":null},"replies":35,"retweets":115,"likes":470,"bookmarks":803,"quotes":16,"created_at":"Mon Aug 17 03:42:45 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1786938165,"possibly_sensitive":false,"views":68226,"is_note_tweet":false,"community_note":null,"lang":"zh","replying_to":null,"replying_to_status":null,"source":"Twitter Web App","card":{"url":"https://github.com/davinci-seven/wechat-article-pipeline","title":"GitHub - davinci-seven/wechat-article-pipeline: 面向 Windows 和 AI Agent 的公众号文章排版流水线：Markdown + 本地配图 →...","description":"面向 Windows 和 AI Agent 的公众号文章排版流水线：Markdown + 本地配图 → 公众号兼容内联 HTML、发布稳定版、390px 手机预览、长截图与完整性校验报告。不改原稿，不自动发布。 - davinci-seven/wechat-article-pipeline","domain":"github.com","image":{"width":800,"height":419,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2089196208963141632/x6dzNOyC?format=jpg&name=800x419"}},"article":{"created_at":"2026-08-17T03:42:45.000Z","modified_at":"2026-08-17T03:42:45.000Z","id":"2089193819954696192","title":"手调半小时的公众号排版，这篇25秒排完了","preview_text":"写完一篇文章，最烦的往往不是写，是发。\nMarkdown在自己编辑器里明明好好的，复制进公众号后台，标题变成一行光秃秃的井号，粗体的星号全露在外面，图片直接没了。","cover_media":{"id":"QXBpTWVkaWE6DAAFCgABHP5QWOPWEAAKAAIVDWGVj9cwAQAA","media_id":"2089195619856289792","media_info":{"__typename":"ApiImage","color_info":{"palette":[{"percentage":94.59,"rgb":{"blue":251,"green":249,"red":248}},{"percentage":3.11,"rgb":{"blue":144,"green":120,"red":105}},{"percentage":1.95,"rgb":{"blue":82,"green":34,"red":7}},{"percentage":0.15,"rgb":{"blue":38,"green":28,"red":19}},{"percentage":0.11,"rgb":{"blue":187,"green":224,"red":188}}]},"original_img_height":793,"original_img_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HP5QWOPWEAAtY4b.jpg","original_img_width":1983},"media_key":"3_2089195619856289792"},"content":{"blocks":[{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"c0ue1","text":"写完一篇文章，最烦的往往不是写，是发。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5jprk","text":"Markdown在自己编辑器里明明好好的，复制进公众号后台，标题变成一行光秃秃的井号，粗体的星号全露在外面，图片直接没了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"1it11","text":"左边是直接粘进去的样子，右边是这套流水线排完再粘的样子。同一篇文章，同一批图。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":0,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8okg6","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2nt2n","text":"右边那版，我花了不到半分钟。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3jf9s","text":"不是估计，是刚才排这篇文章时掐的表：3864个字，5张图，从敲命令到全部产出，25秒。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"jlvl","text":"以前这段时间我在干什么？调标题、调图片宽度、调代码块，调完这段发现上段间距又歪了。半小时起步，文章一个字没改，人先烦了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7svnl","text":"我前阵子在几个群里看到，有人专门花钱解决这件事。有买排版软件的，几十、几百都有；有人长期订阅在线工具；还有人嫌麻烦，干脆每篇花钱找人代排。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"b3509","text":"这个需求当然是真的。但这笔钱可以不花。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"eqsfn","text":"先把东西给你","type":"header-one"},{"data":{"urls":[{"fromIndex":5,"text":"https://github.com/davinci-seven/wechat-article-pipeline","toIndex":61}]},"entityRanges":[{"key":1,"length":56,"offset":5}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3ju4m","text":"仓库在这：https://github.com/davinci-seven/wechat-article-pipeline","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5kc0v","text":"MIT协议，拿去用。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"a6d3n","text":"把定稿的Markdown和配图放进一个文件夹，跑一条命令：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":2,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8aqau","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3qdgl","text":"浏览器会自动弹出这一页。点右上角那个绿色按钮，去公众号后台Ctrl+V，完事。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":3,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"e2t1t","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3sic7","text":"排版原样进去，不用再调。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"32qf","text":"嫌命令麻烦，把文章文件夹直接拖到公众号排版.bat上，一样。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"12n","text":"换个主题，就是另一套视觉","type":"header-one"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":4,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7s5n5","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":5,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"bh0tf","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ctag","text":"一共六套。橄榄手记适合深度评测和案例复盘，摸鱼绿适合教程和工具盘点，红白色系适合观点文，石墨极简风适合科技和设计类，留白禅意风适合随笔，摸鱼票据风适合工具对比。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"eprma","text":"同一篇稿子换个参数重跑，几十秒的事。选哪套看你号的调性。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"b75sl","text":"跑的时候屏幕上是什么样","type":"header-one"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2k72","text":"一共八步，自己往下走：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":6,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"eggvl","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2lom1","text":"跑完你手上会有四样东西。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4vnpp","text":"预览页，就是上面那张带绿按钮的，用来复制。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"6k7tb","text":"发布稳定版，图片全部内嵌进HTML，不依赖你电脑上的任何路径。普通HTML里图片可能还写着C:\\Users\\xxx\\Desktop\\文章\\assets\\01.png，换台电脑就废了。这一版你可以发给别人、换电脑打开、过几个月再翻出来，图还在。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4cdub","text":"390px手机长截图，发之前先看到读者手机上是什么样。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"6a6gg","text":"还有一堆检查报告：原稿哈希、HTML合规校验、隐私扫描，以及一张图片证据表——每张图的顺序、路径、所属章节和图注都列出来。图一多，人脑靠不住，机器既然知道你引用了哪些图，就该顺手把证据留下。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"c66b1","text":"另外有三件事它不会干：不改你的原稿，不替你发布，图片少一张就停下来报错。跑之前跑完各算一次SHA256，对不上直接中止。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"914np","text":"到这儿你已经可以去用了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"15mjc","text":"下面是我踩过的坑，想看就看。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"fp5t4","text":"有一次，我发现自己在假装截图成功","type":"header-one"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"u4va","text":"390px长截图这个功能，README里很早就写上了：一键生成。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"e5ejr","text":"后来复核代码，突然发现不对。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"blp0t","text":"脚本根本没截图。它只是检查「长截图这个文件在不在」，文件在，就算成功。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"d72t4","text":"问题是，谁生成的？","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"f673t","text":"没人生成。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2gph5","text":"文档写了一个并不存在的能力。这种事我接受不了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"rmtl","text":"最后重新接了Playwright，让浏览器真的以390px视口打开手机预览页再完整截下来。文章太长一次截不完，就自动分段再拼。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3g2b0","text":"从那以后我给自己定了条规矩：文档里写「支持」，必须真的跑通过一次。代码里有个同名函数不算。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"bh6eb","text":"更离谱的一次，是隐私检查自己骗了自己","type":"header-one"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8pc7n","text":"因为要把仓库公开，后面加了一层公开前脱敏：绝对路径、用户名、Token、私钥、邮箱、IP，全扫一遍。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"eggvp","text":"有一次检查结果特别漂亮，privacy-audit.json里写着0 ERROR。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"e7610","text":"结果翻Git仓库，发现里面居然真的已经提交了我的本机绝对路径。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5ddn6","text":"我第一反应是，那你这个检查器检查了个啥？","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"9ua1i","text":"一路往下查，根因特别Windows。PowerShell 5.1里的Tee-Object默认把日志写成UTF-16LE，而我的脱敏脚本一直按UTF-8读。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"dca6l","text":"所以日志不是没扫。它扫了，只不过读进去全是乱码，正则当然什么都匹配不到。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"6dsbf","text":"然后检查器一本正经地告诉我：0 ERROR。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5s1bn","text":"后来整个重写了，日志显式写UTF-8，脱敏脚本按BOM识别编码。顺着这条线查下去，还发现泄露路径的日志不止一个，是三个。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"e53qb","text":"这套东西从此多了一条规矩：生成的结果，不能把你的电脑一起发出去。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"68a78","text":"还有一次，是别人替我抓出来的","type":"header-one"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"204v0","text":"前两个是我自己发现的，第三个不是。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"eoj84","text":"我请外部做了一轮代码审核，被指出渲染器遇到不支持的Markdown语法不会停，会默默改样子还报成功。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"f7801","text":"拿探测稿一跑，确实如此。引用块的大于号留在正文里，斜体和删除线的符号原样显示，列表里的粗体和行内代码被剥光，夹在句子中间的图片直接消失。而完整性校验比的是剥掉格式后的纯文本，所以它照样告诉我「正文顺序通过」。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"23vsm","text":"跟前两个坑是同一个病：表面上成功了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ar0uf","text":"现在补上了引用块、斜体、删除线，修了列表格式被剥的问题。剩下真的不支持的，命中就停，告诉你第几行、什么语法、为什么不行。支持哪些语法，README里单独列了一节。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8mqa0","text":"这套东西到底是谁做的","type":"header-one"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"d5t2e","text":"必须说清楚，最难的底层能力不是我写的。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{"urls":[{"fromIndex":120,"text":"github.com/isjiamu/gzh-design-skill","toIndex":155}]},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"fratt","text":"gzh-design解决了公众号最恶心的那堆兼容性问题：那个编辑器不是正常浏览器环境，style标签、CSS类名、很多布局属性都不能想当然。一键复制预览、HTML检查和主题基础也都是它的。作者是甲木和摸鱼小李，AGPL-3.0协议，仓库在 github.com/isjiamu/gzh-design-skill。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{"mentions":[{"fromIndex":57,"text":"bbkirstry","toIndex":67}]},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"c3lcn","text":"xiaowan-wechat-layout给了我手机端结构检查、图片证据和排版QA这一整套思路。作者是小晚，X是 @bbkirstry。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{"mentions":[{"fromIndex":37,"text":"seekjourney","toIndex":49}]},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"6sd8s","text":"md2wechat解决的是公众号素材上传和草稿创建。作者是极客杰尼，X是 @seekjourney。它有商业授权条款，你要商用记得先去看它的LICENSE。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2dnoo","text":"我干的事很好概括：他们把一个个能力做出来，我把这些能力接成了一条自己愿意每天用的流水线，再补上Windows一键入口、原稿哈希、图片检查、稳定版HTML、长截图、隐私检查和Agent执行规则。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"dcfmn","text":"不是重新发明轮子，是把几个轮子装到了一辆能开的车上。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7qf2f","text":"边界说清楚：六套主题换的是配色和排印，文章结构共用；想要每套组件都不同的，直接用原版gzh-design。gzh-design是AGPL-3.0，我没复制也没重新分发它的源码，只在运行时调用，你需要自己装一下。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"e8k","text":"最后","type":"header-one"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"c9t1e","text":"这套东西我没打算收钱，因为最关键的能力本来就是开源社区给我的。我花时间的部分只是把它们接起来、踩坑、测试。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2nvum","text":"要说回报，我更想要的是：你真的拿去用了，然后告诉我哪儿不好使。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7h5mb","text":"上面那三个项目也一样。你要是觉得这条流水线省了事，记得顺手去给 gzh-design、xiaowan-wechat-layout、md2wechat 点个star，难的部分是他们做的。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7cuaq","text":"最后放一张。这篇文章的公众号版本就是用这套流水线自己排的，390px下从头到尾长这样。下面这张图本身就有11188像素高，是流水线自己截的，横向溢出0，破图0：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":7,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"a0u90","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7ir8o","text":"一个讲排版的东西，要是连自己这篇都排不明白，也没必要拿出来给人用。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4170s","text":"仓库再放一次，clone下来就能跑：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{"urls":[{"fromIndex":0,"text":"https://github.com/davinci-seven/wechat-article-pipeline","toIndex":56}]},"entityRanges":[{"key":8,"length":56,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"6p7m4","text":"https://github.com/davinci-seven/wechat-article-pipeline","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"18t4c","text":"如果你每周都要发公众号，今晚就可以把那半小时省下来。跑通了、或者哪一步卡住了，来仓库开个issue，或者直接在评论区告诉我，我盯着。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":9,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"36b3b","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"cciu8","text":"我是达芬七，人在加拿大十年。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5ootd","text":"写移民、写 AI、写普通人怎么在系统里找活路。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"fmoil","text":"如果觉得有用，","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{"mentions":[{"fromIndex":4,"text":"davinci_seven","toIndex":18}]},"entityRanges":[{"key":10,"length":14,"offset":4}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"e0s2m","text":"关注我 @davinci_seven","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"92ev9","text":"","type":"unstyled"}],"entityMap":[{"key":"8","value":{"data":{"url":"https://github.com/davinci-seven/wechat-article-pipeline"},"mutability":"Mutable","type":"LINK"}},{"key":"4","value":{"data":{"markdown":"```powershell\n.\\tools\\公众号排版.ps1 -ArticleDir .\\我的文章 -Theme red-white\n```"},"mutability":"Mutable","type":"MARKDOWN"}},{"key":"9","value":{"data":{},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"DIVIDER"}},{"key":"5","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"91a408aa-0173-4156-a96e-439d5d50a5b1","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"37","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2089193886518284289"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"10","value":{"data":{"url":"https://x.com/intent/follow?screen_name=davinci_seven"},"mutability":"Mutable","type":"LINK"}},{"key":"6","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"0e9e5635-0877-43a9-9992-cf361e0efdff","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"51","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2089193965673148416"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"1","value":{"data":{"url"